id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42706::$$$message_0347_0000_0000$$$::"You did it, Shinji. I always knew you had it in you.[wait canskip=0 time=800][l][say storage=HSINE_SHI_0020 _name=士郎] Hold me!"::
42707::$$$message_0347_0001_0000$$$::"I hate to admit it, but you win.[wait canskip=0 time=800][l][say storage=HSINE_RIN_0020 _name=凛] Hold me!"::
42708::$$$message_0347_0002_0000$$$::"You truly are a legendary hero, Big Brother...! I'm so happy! [wait canskip=0 time=800]Hold me!"::
42709::$$$message_0347_0003_0000$$$::"You're the greatest mage in the world! [wait canskip=0 time=800]Hold me!"::
42710::$$$message_0347_0004_0000$$$::"Yes, yes. Well done, Shinji. [wait canskip=0 time=800][l][say storage=HSINE_RAD_0020 _name=ライダー]Hold me!"::
42711::$$$message_0347_0005_0000$$$::"Mm, why don't you just die? [wait canskip=0 time=800][l][say storage=HSINE_IRI_0020 _name=イリヤ]Hold me!"::
42712::$$$message_0347_0006_0000$$$::"Oh... OOOOOOOHHHHH! [wait canskip=0 time=300]My [wait canskip=0 time=300]wish [wait canskip=0 time=300]came [wait canskip=0 time=300]true[wait canskip=0 time=300]!!!"::
42713::$$$message_0347_0006_0001$$$::"Did you see that, Tohsaka, Emiya!? That is what it means to be a true genius!"::
42714::$$$message_0347_0007_0000$$$::"If this is a dream, I never wanna wake up!"::
42716::$$$message_0347_0008_0000$$$::"BAD END"[rf]::

